Avis_BMP_1b_i_8b_1, 			 "For a 1b or 8b BMP without palette you must give the BMP filename followed by the IMG filename. For a 1b or 8b BMP with palette you must give the BMP and DBF filenames, in this order, followed by the IMG filename." 
Avis_BMP_1b_i_8b_2, 			 "If the BMP file type is different, you must give the BMP filename, followed by the R, G and B IMG filenames, in this order."
Avis_BMP_1b, 				 "For a 1b BMP without palette you must give the BMP filename followed by the IMG filename. For a 1b BMP with palette you must give the BMP and DBF filenames, in this order, followed by the IMG filename."
Avis_BMP_4b, 				 "A 4b BMP is expected. In that case you must give the BMP filename, followed by the R, G and B IMG filenames, in this order."
Avis_BMP_8b, 				 "An 8b uncompressed BMP is expected. For an 8b BMP without palette you must give the BMP filename followed by the IMG filename. For an 8b BMP with palette you must give the BMP and DBF filenames, in this order, followed by the IMG filename."
Avis_BMP_8bRLE, 				 "An 8b RLE-8 compressed BMP is expected. In that case you must give the BMP filename, followed by the R, G and B IMG filenames, in this order."
Avis_BMP_16b, 				 "A 16b BMP is expected. In that case you must give the BMP filename, followed by the R, G and B IMG filenames, in this order."
Avis_BMP_24b, 				 "A 24b BMP is expected. In that case you must give the BMP filename, followed by the R, G and B IMG filenames, in this order."
Avis_BMP_32b, 				 "A 32b BMP is expected. In that case you must give the BMP filename, followed by the R, G and B IMG filenames, in this order."

